ULMTCS-2#1 Warning
Control Sets use limits require reduction  
This design uses 1401 control sets (vs. available limit of 8150, determined by 1 control set per CLB). This exceeds the control set use guideline of 15 percent. This is at a level where reduction is REQUIRED (see UG949). Use report_control_sets to get more details.
